\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Thank you my God and Master
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 with my whole heart I do
\par I shall praise your name always
\par because you have saved me
\par I shall praise your name always
\par because you have saved me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Your pleading voice of mercy
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 your mighty strength and power
\par \cf1 you brought it down to save me\cf0 
\par out of the devil's arms
\par With love you snatched me from
\par the devil's arms to safety.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Now I am all relieved
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 no more carry my sins
\par so I 'll be ever with you
\par and stay with you always
\par O! Jesus I am yours and will
\par abide always with you.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
